# Default: let git normalise source text files to LF inside the repository.
* text=auto
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary

# Keep the dataset files byte-for-byte as they are (later lines override the default above).
# ClearKYC-Dataset/checksums.txt and the dataset result files were computed over LF text with no byte-order mark; converting them to CRLF
# (git's default on Windows) would make `npm run verify:checksums` fail for anyone who clones the project.
ClearKYC-Dataset/** -text
dataset/** -text
generator/reports/** -text
documentation/source_manifest.md -text
